          "title": "You'll want to know: સભા",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "સભા — sabhā — \"a gathering; an assembly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "સાંજે ગામમાં મોટી સભા થઈ. sā̃je gāmmā̃ moṭī sabhā thaī. In the evening there was a big gathering in the village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "is a tatsama, Sanskrit sabhā, \"an assembly, a meeting place\" (Monier-Williams). A સભા is people gathered to hear and to decide; બેઠક is a smaller meeting."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
