              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બિરદાવવું — birdāvvũ — \"to applaud; to praise publicly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બધાએ અરુણના સાહસને બિરદાવ્યું. badhāe Aruṇnā sāhasne birdāvyũ. Everyone applauded Arun's courage."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે તેને બિરદાવ્યો, teṇe tene birdāvyo."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "is built on birad, praise, from Sanskrit viruda, \"a laudatory poem\", which Monier-Williams also gives as birada. વખાણવું is to praise; બિરદાવવું (birdāvvũ) is to praise in public, before others."
            }
          ]
        },
